form. The boundary uses the outward orientation, including (-1)^k. -/
theorem integral_extDeriv_lowerHalfspace {n : ℕ} (k : Fin (n+1)) (R : ℝ)
    (ω : (Fin (n+1) → ℝ) → (Fin (n+1) → ℝ) [⋀^Fin n]→L[ℝ] ℝ)
