localized form stays strictly inside the domain. -/
theorem integral_extDeriv_interior_support {n : ℕ} {s : Set (Fin (n+1) → ℝ)}
    (ω : (Fin (n+1) → ℝ) → (Fin (n+1) → ℝ) [⋀^Fin n]→L[ℝ] ℝ)
